// Viking 12 (1955).
// Martin's Viking, the Naval Research Laboratory sounding rocket that became Vanguard's first
// stage. Viking 12 reached 254 km.
// Built by hand from plain parts: the tanks stand above the tail section that holds the
// gimballed engine, and the instruments ride in the nose.
